{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>תיעשה המנורה.</b> Plene with yod alludes to the ten menorot that Solomon was destined to make." "<b>ירכה.</b> This is the thigh below, which is made like a wooden block — טבונ\"ק in the foreign tongue — long and somewhat broad and thick, and three legs emerge from it. And the Sages, blessed be their memory, said: the height of the menorah was eighteen handbreadths. And an allusion to this from what is written in the section בהעלותך: וזה מעשה המנורה — and וזה מעשה in gematria is eighteen."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {1 "טבונ\"ק is a transliterated Old French term left as found in the manuscript."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:06.012279726Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}